MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_001: You did it, Cai! You figured out a way to save\nyour dad! This should work, right?
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_002: I don't know... I hope. First, I need to find someone\nwho can help me with this whole thing.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_003: But this is the last shot I've got to save him.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_004: Cai, I'm sure that you're right about this. Don't let\nfear get the best of you now.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_005: And, besides, your dad and Aurora are such a cute\ncouple! Let's do everything we can to help them!
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_006: Tialla! Maybe lower your voice a bit?!
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_007: <NCA>Ask about the circumstances.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_008: Um... So, I've got a plan to bust my dad out of\nthe dungeon he's locked up in.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_009: I wanted to free him by winning the Heroic Games.\nThat was the best way to do it. But I lost...
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_010: You know about what's going on with my dad, right?\nI just can't give up on him. I'll do whatever it takes.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_011: I told you I'd find a way to save him. Well, I've\nfound one.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_012: I learned that something's going to happen at the\narena soon. A big...disturbance of some sort.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_013: I thought that'd be the perfect time to break Pop\nout of there—during all the confusion!
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m01_014: It'd be great if you could help us out.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m03_001: We lost the Heroic Games because I wasn't\nstrong enough.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m03_002: But, I'm not giving up! Whatever it takes, I'm gonna\nsave Pop.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m03_003: That whole big disturbance at the arena is planned\nfor {SetColor=Gold}{DateTime=ParalogueDay, Char00} {DateTime=ParalogueMonth, Char00}{SetColor=Default}. Find me by Oxum 22.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m04: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m04_001: Cai, shouldn't we be getting ready? The disturbance\nwill be starting soon.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m04_002: That's right! Hey, listen, it's kind of sudden, but will\nyou help us out?
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m04_003: We lost the Heroic Games because I wasn't\nstrong enough.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m04_004: But, I'm not giving up! Whatever it takes, I'm gonna\nsave Pop.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m04_005: Tomorrow's the big day, but we still need to prepare.\nIf you want to help, let me know at any time today.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m05: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m05_001: I've got a plan. There's a disturbance coming that I'm\ngoing to use as cover to help my pop escape.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m05_002: Please... It'd be great if you could help us out.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m05_No: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m05_007: Oh yeah? Well, it isn't the day of the plan just yet.\nIf you change your mind, let me know!
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m06: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m06_001: I've got a plan. There's a disturbance coming that I'm\ngoing to use as cover to help my pop escape.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m06_002: I won't get another chance to save him. I'm begging\nyou to help me out.
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m06_No: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_00_m06_007: Oh yeah? Well, if you change your mind, let me\nknow before the end of the day.